{"body":{"of":{"$ref":"01M6W3V0811DN2N8YSM1H6KDBZ"},"title":"The third session, measuring"},"id":"01M6W3V08EQCMC2KAJ7ATR5GBJ","instance":["01M6SMRS977B9PNDXB497RY8NS"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"says":"The grade given to something said. The author's practice, which he calls using measures: when something is said it is given a measure, such as that it is not yet owned by the build structure, and a value, and graded, so that what matters is not forgotten and its words stay as they were said."},"id":"01M6W3V08ESHZH4GN614H6XRAG","instance":[],"kind":"version","mould":{"as":{"says":"What it is measured by, as the author would name it: marked, as a reader marks a book; not yet owned by the build structure; or verbatim.","shape":"string"},"by":{"holds":false,"says":"The voice that measured it.","shape":"ref"},"note":{"optional":true,"says":"Why it was marked, in a few words: a note in the margin, written with curiosity rather than as one who knows what is good.","shape":"string"},"of":{"holds":false,"says":"What was said that is measured: its sentences, or a whole utterance.","shape":{"set":"ref"}},"owned":{"holds":false,"optional":true,"says":"The brief that already holds what was said, where the structure owns it; unsaid where nothing built owns it yet.","shape":{"set":"ref"}},"thread":{"holds":false,"optional":true,"says":"The thread that takes it in, where one does.","shape":"ref"},"value":{"says":"Its grade: 3 not to be forgotten, 2 steers what is built, 1 noted. A scale for now, the author's to change.","shape":"number"}},"name":"measure","prev":null}
{"body":{"says":"A matter raised in what was said and not yet owned by what is built: what it asks, where the author left it, the sentences it was raised in, and the briefs it bears on. The author's own words stay its ground, pointed at and never retold as settled; held as a holon because that is the respectful way to hold another's words."},"id":"01M6W3V08EZAS7W5P34D29HC2S","instance":[],"kind":"version","mould":{"asks":{"says":"What it holds open, or what was said that steers, in the session's words.","shape":"string"},"raised":{"holds":false,"says":"The author's sentences it was raised in, as they were said.","shape":{"set":"ref"}},"stands":{"says":"open, leaning, settled or let go: as the author left it, not as a brief made it.","shape":"string"},"title":{"says":"The matter in a few words.","shape":"string"},"touches":{"holds":false,"optional":true,"says":"The briefs it bears on, where one says more or less than the author did.","shape":{"set":"ref"}}},"name":"thread","prev":null}
{"body":{"says":"The whole holding the threads raised from what was said, so they stand in one place and not each at the field's top."},"id":"01M6W3V08EJ7RF1W5MR7HP4J6K","instance":[],"kind":"version","mould":{"threads":{"holds":true,"says":"The threads, in the order they were raised, oldest last.","shape":{"list":"ref"}}},"name":"threads","prev":null}
